<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<PermissionSet xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <label>Event AM</label>
    <description>Account Managers: create events, import attendee lists, add and submit invitees, run the approved-invitee reports. Note what is absent as of R5 — no Contact, Lead or Account permission of any kind. The import reads and writes exactly one object, Event_Attendee__c, so this set no longer needs to reach a single standard object, and the Lead grant that R4 required has been removed rather than left lying around.</description>
